{
  "name": "吸收刺青 Absorbing Tattoo",
  "type": "equipment",
  "img": "icons/tools/scribal/burnisher-tooth.webp",
  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<div class=\"WordSection1\"><p class=\"wordsection1\"><span style=\"font-family:Signika, sans-serif\">覆盖区域：两条肢体，或者胸膛，或者上背部</span></p><div class=\"WordSection1\"><p class=\"wordsection1\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE:11pt;mso-bidi-font-family:Arial;mso-ascii-font-family:Arial;mso-hansi-font-family:Arial\">该魔法刺青用一根特殊的针制作，且其图案特别突出了一种颜色。</span><br><em><strong>刺青同调</strong></em><span style=\"FONT-SIZE:11pt;mso-bidi-font-family:Arial;mso-ascii-font-family:Arial;mso-hansi-font-family:Arial\">。同调此物品时，你需要将针持握，并抵在你想要让刺</span> <span style=\"FONT-SIZE:11pt;mso-bidi-font-family:Arial;mso-ascii-font-family:Arial;mso-hansi-font-family:Arial\">青出现</span> <span style=\"FONT-SIZE:11pt;mso-bidi-font-family:Arial;mso-ascii-font-family:Arial;mso-hansi-font-family:Arial\">的那处皮肤上。当同调完成时，针头会化为墨水再变成刺青。</span> <br><span style=\"FONT-SIZE:11pt;mso-bidi-font-family:Arial;mso-ascii-font-family:Arial;mso-hansi-font-family:Arial\">若你与刺青的同调结束，刺青会消失，针头会再次出现在你的位置中。</span> <br><em><strong>伤害抗性</strong></em> <span style=\"FONT-SIZE:11pt;mso-bidi-font-family:Arial;mso-ascii-font-family:Arial;mso-hansi-font-family:Arial\">。当刺青在你的皮肤上时，你拥有与刺青颜色相联系的一种伤害抗性，如下方表格所示。</span>DM<span style=\"FONT-SIZE:11pt;mso-bidi-font-family:Arial;mso-ascii-font-family:Arial;mso-hansi-font-family:Arial\">可以自己选择或随机决定刺青颜色。</span><br><em><strong>伤害吸收</strong></em><span style=\"FONT-SIZE:11pt;mso-bidi-font-family:Arial;mso-ascii-font-family:Arial;mso-hansi-font-family:Arial\">。当你受到与刺青所选伤害种类一致的伤害时，你可以用你的反应获得对该次伤害的免疫，而后你回复等同于你原先要受到伤害数值一半的生命值。使用后，直到下次黎明前，这个反应不能再次使用。</span></p></div><table class=\"MsoNormalTable\" style=\"BORDER-COLLAPSE:collapse;mso-padding-alt:0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;mso-yfti-tbllook:1184\" border=\"0\"><tbody><tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow:0;mso-yfti-firstrow:yes\"><td style=\"BORDER-TOP:medium none;BORDER-RIGHT:medium none;BORDER-BOTTOM:#8eaadb 1pt solid;PADDING-BOTTOM:0cm;PADDING-TOP:0cm;PADDING-LEFT:5.4pt;BORDER-LEFT:medium none;PADDING-RIGHT:5.4pt;mso-border-bottom-alt:solid #8EAADB .5pt;mso-border-bottom-themecolor:accent1;mso-border-bottom-themetint:153\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span><strong>d10</strong></span></p></td><td style=\"BORDER-TOP:medium none;BORDER-RIGHT:medium none;BORDER-BOTTOM:#8eaadb 1pt solid;PADDING-BOTTOM:0cm;PADDING-TOP:0cm;PADDING-LEFT:5.4pt;BORDER-LEFT:medium none;PADDING-RIGHT:5.4pt;mso-border-bottom-alt:solid #8EAADB .5pt;mso-border-bottom-themecolor:accent1;mso-border-bottom-themetint:153\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><strong>伤害类型</strong></p></td><td style=\"BORDER-TOP:medium none;BORDER-RIGHT:medium none;BORDER-BOTTOM:#8eaadb 1pt solid;PADDING-BOTTOM:0cm;PADDING-TOP:0cm;PADDING-LEFT:5.4pt;BORDER-LEFT:medium none;PADDING-RIGHT:5.4pt;mso-border-bottom-alt:solid #8EAADB .5pt;mso-border-bottom-themecolor:accent1;mso-border-bottom-themetint:153\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><strong>颜色</strong></p></td></tr><tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow:1\"><td style=\"BACKGROUND:#d9e2f3;PADDING-BOTTOM:0cm;PADDING-TOP:0cm;PADDING-LEFT:5.4pt;PADDING-RIGHT:5.4pt;mso-background-themecolor:accent1;mso-background-themetint:51\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><strong>1</strong></p></td><td style=\"BACKGROUND:#d9e2f3;PADDING-BOTTOM:0cm;PADDING-TOP:0cm;PADDING-LEFT:5.4pt;PADDING-RIGHT:5.4pt;mso-background-themecolor:accent1;mso-background-themetint:51\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE:11pt;COLOR:black;mso-bidi-font-family:Arial;mso-ascii-font-family:Arial;mso-hansi-font-family:Arial;mso-color-alt:windowtext\">强酸</span></p></td><td style=\"BACKGROUND:#d9e2f3;PADDING-BOTTOM:0cm;PADDING-TOP:0cm;PADDING-LEFT:5.4pt;PADDING-RIGHT:5.4pt;mso-background-themecolor:accent1;mso-background-themetint:51\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE:11pt;COLOR:black;mso-bidi-font-family:Arial;mso-ascii-font-family:Arial;mso-hansi-font-family:Arial;mso-color-alt:windowtext\">绿色</span></p></td></tr><tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow:2\"><td style=\"PADDING-BOTTOM:0cm;PADDING-TOP:0cm;PADDING-LEFT:5.4pt;PADDING-RIGHT:5.4pt\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span><strong>2</strong></span></p></td><td style=\"PADDING-BOTTOM:0cm;PADDING-TOP:0cm;PADDING-LEFT:5.4pt;PADDING-RIGHT:5.4pt\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span>寒冷</span></p></td><td style=\"PADDING-BOTTOM:0cm;PADDING-TOP:0cm;PADDING-LEFT:5.4pt;PADDING-RIGHT:5.4pt\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE:11pt;mso-bidi-font-family:Arial;mso-ascii-font-family:Arial;mso-hansi-font-family:Arial\">蓝色</span></p></td></tr><tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow:3\"><td style=\"BACKGROUND:#d9e2f3;PADDING-BOTTOM:0cm;PADDING-TOP:0cm;PADDING-LEFT:5.4pt;PADDING-RIGHT:5.4pt;mso-background-themecolor:accent1;mso-background-themetint:51\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span><strong>3</strong></span></p></td><td style=\"BACKGROUND:#d9e2f3;PADDING-BOTTOM:0cm;PADDING-TOP:0cm;PADDING-LEFT:5.4pt;PADDING-RIGHT:5.4pt;mso-background-themecolor:accent1;mso-background-themetint:51\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span>火焰</span></p></td><td style=\"BACKGROUND:#d9e2f3;PADDING-BOTTOM:0cm;PADDING-TOP:0cm;PADDING-LEFT:5.4pt;PADDING-RIGHT:5.4pt;mso-background-themecolor:accent1;mso-background-themetint:51\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE:11pt;COLOR:black;mso-bidi-font-family:Arial;mso-ascii-font-family:Arial;mso-hansi-font-family:Arial;mso-color-alt:windowtext\">红色</span></p></td></tr><tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow:4\"><td style=\"PADDING-BOTTOM:0cm;PADDING-TOP:0cm;PADDING-LEFT:5.4pt;PADDING-RIGHT:5.4pt\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span><strong>4</strong></span></p></td><td style=\"PADDING-BOTTOM:0cm;PADDING-TOP:0cm;PADDING-LEFT:5.4pt;PADDING-RIGHT:5.4pt\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE:11pt;mso-bidi-font-family:Arial;mso-ascii-font-family:Arial;mso-hansi-font-family:Arial\">力场</span></p></td><td style=\"PADDING-BOTTOM:0cm;PADDING-TOP:0cm;PADDING-LEFT:5.4pt;PADDING-RIGHT:5.4pt\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE:11pt;mso-bidi-font-family:Arial;mso-ascii-font-family:Arial;mso-hansi-font-family:Arial\">白色</span></p></td></tr><tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow:5\"><td style=\"BACKGROUND:#d9e2f3;PADDING-BOTTOM:0cm;PADDING-TOP:0cm;PADDING-LEFT:5.4pt;P